0000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,8,351,0,10,1Style: Karaoke - Copy - Copy,Duality,55,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00E4BA0F,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,8,373,0,10,1Style: Kanji Gray,Duality,55,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00807C7A,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,8,10,10,110,1Style: Kanji - Copy,Duality,80,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00E4BA0F,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,8,390,0,130,1Style: Kanji Red,Duality,80,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H004735D0,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,8,10,10,130,1Style: Kanji Blue,Duality,80,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00C4370F,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,8,72,0,130,1Style: Kanji Green,Duality,80,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H004CD27B,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,8,384,10,130,1Style: Kanji Pink,Duality,80,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00A67DFı,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,8,10,10,130,1Style: Kanji Yellow,Duality,80,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H003493DA,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,8,335,0,130,1Style: Kanji - Copy - Copy,Duality,55,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00E4BA0F,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,8,350,0,110,1Style: Translation Gray,Duality,55,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00807C7A,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,2,10,10,10,1Style: Translation - Copy,Duality,80,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00E4BA0F,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,2,10,10,10,1Style: Translation Red,Duality,80,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H004735D0,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,2,10,10,10,1Style: Translation Blue,Duality,80,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00C4370F,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,2,10,10,10,1Style: Translation Green,Duality,80,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H004CD27B,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,2,10,10,10,1Style: Translation Pink,Duality,80,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00A67DFı,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,2,10,10,10,1Style: Translation Yellow,Duality,80,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H003493DA,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,2,10,10,10,1Style: Translation - Copy - Copy,Duality,80,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00E4BA0F,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,2,545,0,10,1Style: Lyrics,Kozuka Mincho Pro H,45,&H00FFFFFF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00030303,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,110,100,1,0,1,2.25,0,2,22,22,18,1[Events]Format: Layer, Start, End, Style, Name, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, Effect, Text﻿[Script Info]; Script generated by Aegisub 3.2.2; http://www.aegisub.org/Title: Default Aegisub fileScriptType: v4.00+WrapStyle: 0ScaledBorderAndShadow: yesYCbCr Matrix: NonePlayResX: 1280PlayResY: 720Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.11,0:01:53.90,Title,,0,0,0,,Ohara vs. The World GovernmentDialogue: 0,0:01:58.84,0:02:00.46,Main,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Robin?Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.71,0:02:04.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Was my mother here?Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.38,0:02:10.35,Main,,0,0,0,,What're you saying? There's no way that your mother is on Ohara, right?Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.44,0:02:13.98,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'm too far down this path, so I must sever ties.Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.98,0:02:16.36,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I can't make her the daughter of a criminal.Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.15,0:02:19.36,Main,,0,0,0,,What's this about all of a sudden?Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.36,0:02:21.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah...Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.06,0:02:23.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right! There's trouble!Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.40,0:02:26.05,Main,,0,0,0,,I heard that Navy battleships are coming.Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.05,0:02:28.12,Main,,0,0,0,,They’re gonna arrest all the scholars on the island!Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.12,0:02:31.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Is there a disturbance or something happening in town?Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.51,0:02:32.96,Main,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.96,0:02:35.70,Main,,0,0,0,,That isn't a battleship.Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.70,0:02:39.70,Main,,0,0,0,,We heard that a Government ship just arrived on this island.Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.70,0:02:43.66,Main,,0,0,0,,It'll probably be a more rigorous investigation than ever.Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.66,0:02:47.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Listen, Robin. Even if the Government comes here...Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.13,0:02:51.31,Main,,0,0,0,,you absolutely cannot tell them you're an archaeologist.Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.31,0:02:56.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Since you're small, no one will think that you're a scholar. Got that?Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.40,0:02:59.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Move!Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.24,0:03:04.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop what you're doing! Get outside with your hands in the air!Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.87,0:03:06.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, that's going too far.Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.99,0:03:12.46,Main,,0,0,0,,This Ohara lab is suspected of a serious crime – deciphering Poneglyphs!Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.46,0:03:16.42,Main,,0,0,0,,We must conduct a thorough search, so everyone outside. Now!Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.42,0:03:18.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Treat this place with care.Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.78,0:03:23.21,Main,,0,0,0,,The treasures kept here are more valuable than you can imagine.Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.21,0:03:25.24,Main,,0,0,0,,We have no obligation to listen to you!Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.24,0:03:26.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Take them outside!Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.32,0:03:27.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.40,0:03:29.33,Main,,0,0,0,,To all the townspeople!Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.33,0:03:35.35,Main,,0,0,0,,We now suspect that this island's scholars are devils who wish to destroy the world!Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.35,0:03:36.77,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! Why?!Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.77,0:03:41.40,Main,,0,0,0,,They're world-class scholars and the pride of this island!Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.40,0:03:45.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Consequently, we'll conduct a large-scale search of the entire island!Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.58,0:03:48.85,Main,,0,0,0,,During that time, those who have nothing to do with archaeology...Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.85,0:03:50.76,Main,,0,0,0,,are expected to be carrying an ID...Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.76,0:03:53.87,Main,,0,0,0,,and temporarily take refuge on the evacuation ship on the western shore.Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.87,0:03:55.98,Main,,0,0,0,,An evacuation ship?! Is that really necessary?!Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.98,0:03:59.48,Main,,0,0,0,,If it's the scholars' problem, we have nothing to do with it.Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.48,0:04:01.94,Main,,0,0,0,,So there should be no need for us to leave the island.Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.94,0:04:04.81,Main,,0,0,0,,It's our duty to pass that message to you.Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.81,0:04:09.67,Main,,0,0,0,,What happens to those who ignore our warning...Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.67,0:04:12.77,Main,,0,0,0,,is none of our concern.Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.11,0:04:20.87,Main,,0,0,0,,– Leave town! – Evacuate to the western shore!Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.87,0:04:23.00,Main,,0,0,0,,The World Government is up to something!Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.95,0:04:28.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Ahhh! I'm shot!Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.68,0:04:31.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Th-This is the end! I'm a goner, dammit!Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.68,0:04:36.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Tell the bosses… my position as chief… give it to my boy…!Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.29,0:04:38.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Chief, please take a close look.Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.46,0:04:40.82,Main,,0,0,0,,The bullet barely grazed your jacket.Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.82,0:04:42.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.11,0:04:47.06,Main,,0,0,0,,I won't miss next time.Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.94,0:04:52.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, well… What a coincidence to encounter here the skillful fugitive who escaped...Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.24,0:04:56.53,Main,,0,0,0,,the Navy’s prison, don’t you think… Nico Olvia?Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.53,0:05:00.64,Main,,0,0,0,,You kept denying your connection to the Ohara scholars, and yet, here you are.Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.64,0:05:06.08,Main,,0,0,0,,It looks like you're telling us where you're from.Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.08,0:05:10.55,Main,,0,0,0,,And that the scholars here are commiting the same crimes as you were.Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.55,0:05:15.27,Main,,0,0,0,,This proves nothing of the sort.Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.27,0:05:21.07,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you've come up with lots of excuses. You're a smart woman, after all.Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.07,0:05:23.02,Main,,0,0,0,,But none of that matters anymore.Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.02,0:05:26.61,Main,,0,0,0,,We have no need to prove your connection to Ohara.Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.61,0:05:29.45,Main,,0,0,0,,If we dig up every nook and cranny...Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.45,0:05:33.55,Main,,0,0,0,,the evidence of your research on the Poneglyphs will turn up in no time.Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.55,0:05:37.41,Main,,0,0,0,,The Government estimates a 100% probability of this outcome.Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.41,0:05:42.49,Main,,0,0,0,,For six long years, you escaped from sea to sea. To capture you like we did...Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.49,0:05:45.70,Main,,0,0,0,,was just the encouragement the Government needed.Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.70,0:05:49.89,Main,,0,0,0,,There are plenty of Poneglyph researchers across the world.Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.89,0:05:53.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Whenever we caught one, we tried hard to find their connection to Ohara.Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.39,0:05:55.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Can you guess why?Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.36,0:05:58.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me... they plan to use Ohara as a warning?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.85,0:06:03.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Exactly! If Ohara, the holy land of archaeology, were to be destroyed...Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.62,0:06:05.32,Main,,0,0,0,,it'd send a message to all other scholars.Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.32,0:06:07.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Then the world will realize...Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.61,0:06:11.27,Main,,0,0,0,,what will happen to those who dare to research the Void Century.Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.27,0:06:15.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Then... those Navy Battleships that are standing just off shore...Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.78,0:06:19.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey now... just how much do you know?Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.87,0:06:21.08,Main,,0,0,0,,You are correct.Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.08,0:06:25.42,Main,,0,0,0,,They are there to ensure that not one criminal escapes.Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.42,0:06:29.53,Main,,0,0,0,,But to make it seem legitimate, we must first verify a crime has been commited.Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.53,0:06:31.84,Main,,0,0,0,,We're not pirates, after all.Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.84,0:06:36.18,Main,,0,0,0,,And that's why I came all this way to conduct a deep investigation on this island...Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.18,0:06:40.43,Main,,0,0,0,,and evacuate those who have nothing to do with this.Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.43,0:06:43.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's why I'm here.Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.06,0:06:44.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Get her.Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.29,0:06:59.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop it! The books here are a world treasure!Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.21,0:07:01.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Someone's still here?! Take him outside!Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.08,0:07:03.29,Main,,0,0,0,,– Come! – Dammit, you bastards!Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.29,0:07:07.27,Main,,0,0,0,,There must be a hidden room! Find it!Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.27,0:07:11.27,Captions,,0,0,0,,Ohara's Northwest Coast Saul's LocationDialogue: 0,0:07:11.87,0:07:13.89,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,This is terrible...Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.89,0:07:19.31,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,The battleships are already visible!Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.97,0:07:21.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Is this all of them?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.85,0:07:25.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, gather all the scholars here!Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.28,0:07:27.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Look. The scholars have been captured.Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.73,0:07:29.39,Main,,0,0,0,,What could they have done?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.39,0:07:32.09,Main,,0,0,0,,They said the scholars wanted to destroy the world!Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.09,0:07:33.24,Main,,0,0,0,,That can't be true.Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.24,0:07:35.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Where's the evacuation ship?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.31,0:07:37.25,Main,,0,0,0,,It's at the western shore! Hurry!Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.25,0:07:39.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and go! Hurry to the western shore!Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.87,0:07:43.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Robin... there's an evacuation ship.Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.54,0:07:46.28,Main,,0,0,0,,There's no telling what the Government will do.Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.28,0:07:47.97,Main,,0,0,0,,You should head that way, too.Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.97,0:07:51.93,Main,,0,0,0,,No! Even if I get on that ship, the people there won't be nice!Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.93,0:07:53.61,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm staying here with you guys!Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.61,0:07:56.05,Main,,0,0,0,,– Robin... – Just like you guys, I'm a–Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.05,0:07:57.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Just go already!Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.23,0:08:02.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Working hard, men?Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.15,0:08:04.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you for taking the time to come here, Chief!Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.57,0:08:10.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I never expected to run into a ferocious animal here.Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.00,0:08:17.20,Main,,0,0,0,,I nearly died.Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.20,0:08:18.50,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Olvia...!Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.50,0:08:20.45,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Olvia-san...!Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.45,0:08:24.15,Main,,0,0,0,,All right, listen carefully. This woman is a fugitive.Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.15,0:08:26.10,Main,,0,0,0,,The group she belonged to...Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.10,0:08:28.88,Main,,0,0,0,,was recently executed for deciphering the ancient texts.Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.88,0:08:32.06,Main,,0,0,0,,However, we still don't who who the ringleader is.Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.06,0:08:38.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, if you guys are connected to this woman, this'll go much smoother.Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.24,0:08:42.74,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,How terrible of them to hurt a woman like that.Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.74,0:08:46.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Robin, go to the evacuation ship. Hurry!Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.59,0:08:48.18,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Robin...Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.82,0:08:54.42,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Robin...!Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.09,0:08:59.63,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,You've...Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.68,0:09:06.22,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,gotten so big...!!Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.93,0:09:09.19,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Olvia...Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.94,0:09:14.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Wh-What have they done?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.51,0:09:16.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Have they no respect for the library?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.89,0:09:19.48,Main,,0,0,0,,To think that they'd take such drastic measures...!Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.48,0:09:22.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Whoa... they've made a big show.Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.70,0:09:26.73,Main,,0,0,0,,– Click. – Hello? Is this the chief?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.73,0:09:28.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's me.Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.16,0:09:29.86,Main,,0,0,0,,We've found it!Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.86,0:09:31.45,Main,,0,0,0,,In the basement there's...Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.45,0:09:33.90,Main,,0,0,0,,a secret room that has a big stone resembling a Poneglyph...Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.90,0:09:36.46,Main,,0,0,0,,and research papers regarding the ancient texts!Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.46,0:09:38.11,Main,,0,0,0,,All right. Well done!Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.40,0:09:39.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Click.Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.82,0:09:44.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, scholars of Ohara!Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.32,0:09:48.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Your death sentence has now been decided!Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.67,0:09:50.35,Main,,0,0,0,,It's indeed regrettable...Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.35,0:09:56.15,Main,,0,0,0,,that the world's best archaeologists lose their lives together today.Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.05,0:10:04.01,Main,,0,0,0,,See? What a letdown. That was all I had to do!Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.01,0:10:06.28,Main,,0,0,0,,All that's left is to report this to the Five Elders.Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.28,0:10:07.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Roger.Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.06,0:10:12.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Professor! Are they really going to kill you guys?! They're lying, right?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.30,0:10:14.99,Main,,0,0,0,,All because you can read the ancient texts? Why?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.99,0:10:20.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Idiot! You brat! The purpose of their research is to revive a powerful weapon...Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.75,0:10:23.73,Main,,0,0,0,,and commit mass murder!Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.73,0:10:26.26,Main,,0,0,0,,That's not true! That isn't their intention!Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.26,0:10:30.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Robin, stop it. He won't understand. He's just an errand boy.Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.80,0:10:31.75,Main,,0,0,0,,What'd you say?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.75,0:10:35.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Is it really the weapon itself that the Government is afraid of?Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.60,0:10:36.76,Main,,0,0,0,,– Professor! – Professor Clover!Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.76,0:10:38.51,Main,,0,0,0,,It's connected, Chief.Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.51,0:10:39.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay.Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.55,0:10:41.48,Main,,0,0,0,,– This is good timing. – Huh?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.48,0:10:46.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Let me speak to the Five Elders, the world's leaders, before I die.Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.18,0:10:49.75,Main,,0,0,0,,We, the scholars of Ohara, have continued our research for a long time,Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.75,0:10:51.69,Main,,0,0,0,,and although our research isn't finished yet,Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.69,0:10:54.02,Main,,0,0,0,,we formed a hypothesis about the Void Century.Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.02,0:10:56.44,Main,,0,0,0,,So I'd like to report it to them.Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.08,0:10:58.56,Main,,0,0,0,,What rubbish...Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.56,0:10:59.91,Main,,0,0,0,,– Hey. – Yes, sir.Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.91,0:11:02.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Robin, get away from here now!Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.37,0:11:05.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Listening to what I'm about to say is a crime.Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.24,0:11:08.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Professor...Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.04,0:11:11.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, apparently the scholars have been found guilty.Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.10,0:11:12.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Is that true?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.46,0:11:16.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! Navy battleships are sailing this way from the east!Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.46,0:11:20.27,Main,,0,0,0,,They're gonna do something! Let's hurry to the evacuation ship!Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.27,0:11:21.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Wh-What the...?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.91,0:11:23.72,Main,,0,0,0,,It's a Giant!Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.61,0:11:29.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Where are you, Robin?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.56,0:11:33.66,Main,,0,0,0,,You need to hurry up and escape from this island!Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.38,0:11:41.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Has the Buster Call been enacted yet?Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.37,0:11:43.79,Main,,0,0,0,,We're still on standby.Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.79,0:11:45.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry!Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.79,0:11:47.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Run to the evacuation ship!Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.80,0:11:53.80,Main,,0,0,0,,So this is a Poneglyph, huh?Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.80,0:11:58.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Apparently if we were to try and blow it up, it wouldn't get a scratch.Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.26,0:12:03.73,Main,,0,0,0,,What a creepy stone... I can't believe these things are scattered around the world...Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.73,0:12:05.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Is that right?Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.05,0:12:07.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, they deserve the death penalty.Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.35,0:12:11.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Since we seized the evidence, we'll carry out your orders.Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.80,0:12:16.14,Main,,0,0,0,,It cannot be helped. This is quite unfortunate;Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.14,0:12:20.51,Main,,0,0,0,,however, they violated the world's laws. We cannot overlook it.Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.51,0:12:24.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Cut the transparent pleasantries, Five Elders!Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.36,0:12:25.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Wha...!Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.32,0:12:29.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't be rude! You're talking to the leaders of the world!Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.77,0:12:33.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Is this Ohara's Professor Clover, the authority of archaeology?Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.39,0:12:39.11,Main,,0,0,0,,I know your name well, since you've contributed to the world's culture.Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.11,0:12:42.31,Main,,0,0,0,,To think that someone of your caliber would take the wrong path...Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.31,0:12:45.32,Main,,0,0,0,,The past belongs to all mankind.Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.02,0:12:52.53,Main,,0,0,0,,No one has the right to stop us from wanting to know our unspoken history!Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.53,0:12:53.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Professor...Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.46,0:12:57.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Deciphering the Poneglyphs makes it possible to revive the ancient weapon,Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.56,0:12:59.80,Main,,0,0,0,,which puts the world in danger.Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.92,0:13:02.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Even if your research has the best of intentions,Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.76,0:13:06.66,Main,,0,0,0,,all it takes is for someone to come along and use your research.Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.10,0:13:11.31,Main,,0,0,0,,No matter what happened in the past, if humans created that history,Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.31,0:13:13.26,Main,,0,0,0,,we should accept all of it.Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.26,0:13:15.56,Main,,0,0,0,,If we fearlessly learn all we can...Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.56,0:13:18.22,Main,,0,0,0,,we will find solutions no matter what happens.Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.22,0:13:19.68,Main,,0,0,0,,That's an idealistic argument.Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.68,0:13:25.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Is that so? Isn't that reasoning just a convenient excuse for you?Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.41,0:13:28.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Of the facts that still remain...Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.44,0:13:33.07,Main,,0,0,0,,we are most interested in the Poneglyphs...Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.07,0:13:34.87,Main,,0,0,0,,and the very reason for their existence.Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.87,0:13:39.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Why did the ancients take the trouble to inscribe the text on hard stones...Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.02,0:13:41.96,Main,,0,0,0,,in order to pass it down to the future?Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.96,0:13:44.37,Main,,0,0,0,,They inscribed history on unbreakable stones...Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.37,0:13:46.63,Main,,0,0,0,,and scattered them around the world.Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.63,0:13:50.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Is it not because they thought that their message would be eradicated...Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.38,0:13:54.86,Main,,0,0,0,,if they wrote it on paper or in books?Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.86,0:13:58.76,Main,,0,0,0,,In other words, it is the proof that those who left the Poneglyphs...Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.76,0:14:00.86,Main,,0,0,0,,clearly had an enemy.Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.70,0:14:06.17,Main,,0,0,0,,What're you trying to say, Professor Clover?Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.17,0:14:11.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Assuming they were destroyed by some enemy...Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.22,0:14:15.53,Main,,0,0,0,,this enemy must've lived on into history.Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.53,0:14:22.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Coincidentally, just when the Void Century ended 800 years ago,Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.97,0:14:27.69,Main,,0,0,0,,the World Government was founded.Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.52,0:14:35.65,Main,,0,0,0,,If the current World Government was the enemy of those that ceased to exist,Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.65,0:14:38.89,Main,,0,0,0,,one could think that the Void Century is an inconvenient historyDialogue: 0,0:14:38.89,0:14:42.62,Main,,0,0,0,,that was hushed up by the World Government.Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.62,0:14:48.33,Main,,0,0,0,,By analyzing the ancient documents and some Poneglyphs,Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.33,0:14:52.30,Main,,0,0,0,,we eventually discovered the existence of a country.Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.30,0:14:58.11,Main,,0,0,0,,What the documents brought to light was the existence of a grand kingdom.Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.11,0:15:00.95,Main,,0,0,0,,It seems to have boasted hegemony in its time...Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.95,0:15:05.34,Main,,0,0,0,,but someone has obliterated information on this country.   Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.34,0:15:11.51,Main,,0,0,0,,They likely anticipated their defeat to the future World Government...Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.51,0:15:17.32,Main,,0,0,0,,and so inscribed all they knew on those stones to leave their ideas to the future.Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.32,0:15:21.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Indeed, those stones are the Poneglyphs that remain to this very day.Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.03,0:15:25.09,Main,,0,0,0,,I see. That's a bold hypothesis.Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.09,0:15:28.75,Main,,0,0,0,,It's true that the ancient weapon would threaten the world.Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.75,0:15:34.56,Main,,0,0,0,,However, isn't it actually that the World Government is more threatened...Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.56,0:15:39.84,Main,,0,0,0,,by people becoming aware of that kingdom's existence and ideology?Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.60,0:15:44.96,Main,,0,0,0,,We still have to analyze what this threat is,Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.96,0:15:50.60,Main,,0,0,0,,but the name of this once-prosperous kingdom that holds the key to everything is...Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.24,0:15:53.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Eliminate him!Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.87,0:16:06.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Professor!Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.94,0:16:10.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Ohara has...Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.41,0:16:15.38,Main,,0,0,0,,– You bastards! – How dare you...!Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.38,0:16:18.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Professor Clover!Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.22,0:16:20.97,Main,,0,0,0,,come to know too much.Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.61,0:16:25.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Give the attack signal.Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.00,0:16:27.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't move!Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.83,0:16:30.34,Main,,0,0,0,,No one leaves the island.Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.32,0:16:40.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, with this Golden Transponder Snail...Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.44,0:16:42.66,Main,,0,0,0,,that Admiral Sengoku has entrusted to me…Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.66,0:16:43.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Professor!Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.72,0:16:45.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Robin...Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.34,0:16:49.11,Main,,0,0,0,,You fool! You shouldn't be here. Run!Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.11,0:16:51.33,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll initiate a Buster Call!Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.33,0:16:53.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Farewell, Ohara.Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.08,0:16:56.53,Main,,0,0,0,,He did something!Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.62,0:17:00.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry to the evacuation ship, Robin.Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.48,0:17:02.68,Main,,0,0,0,,No! I don't wanna be alone!Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.68,0:17:06.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't say such a foolish thing at a time like this.Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.88,0:17:08.52,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Robin...Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.89,0:17:14.38,Main,,0,0,0,,That's the Buster Call order!Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.89,0:17:14.38,Captions,,0,0,0,,Silver Transponder Snail Receiver for the Golden Transponder SnailDialogue: 0,0:17:14.38,0:17:18.09,Main,,0,0,0,,All battleships, to your positions! Prepare to open fire!Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.51,0:17:21.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey...Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.83,0:17:22.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Look!Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.95,0:17:25.72,Main,,0,0,0,,The Tree of Knowledge is on fire!Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.48,0:17:29.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, World Government! What're you doing?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.14,0:17:32.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Taking our lives should be enough!Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.90,0:17:36.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't look at me. It must've caught fire from the explosions earlier.Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.70,0:17:40.32,Main,,0,0,0,,This isn't a joke!Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.32,0:17:43.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea how many scholarly treasures are in there?Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.18,0:17:44.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! Don't move!Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.66,0:17:47.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Ah... we don't need guns anymore.Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.41,0:17:50.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Those from the Government, pull out.Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.19,0:17:54.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and get the books!Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.83,0:17:58.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Put out the fire in the library!Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.29,0:18:10.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Form a bucket brigade!Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.06,0:18:14.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Get the books outside!Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.50,0:18:30.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Bring that woman with us.Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.13,0:18:32.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Come.Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.81,0:18:38.05,Main,,0,0,0,,There's a piece of information that only she knows.Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.05,0:18:39.97,Main,,0,0,0,,It'll cause a problem if she dies here.Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.04,0:18:45.78,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Mommy.Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.39,0:18:54.18,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Robin...! Please... make sure you escape.Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.18,0:18:56.36,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Don't die, no matter what!Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.94,0:18:58.76,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Nose! Nose!Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.31,0:19:04.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Robin! Hurry!Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.57,0:19:06.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Get out of here now!Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.24,0:19:12.25,Main,,0,0,0,,– Robin-chan! – Robin!Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.11,0:19:23.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you... my mom?Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.26,0:19:32.01,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Olvia! Are you gonna come aboard the ship or not?Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.01,0:19:33.59,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Mommy!Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.59,0:19:38.52,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,– I'll hold her, so go already! – Mommy! Don't go! Mommy!Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.52,0:19:41.27,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Mommy! Mommy!Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.27,0:19:43.40,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Robin.Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.40,0:19:46.48,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I can never call myself your mother again.Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.48,0:19:51.72,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I can't be allowed... to be your mother after all these years.Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.34,0:20:02.96,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,– Monster! – Monster!Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.96,0:20:05.71,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Her mom abandoned her!Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.71,0:20:08.38,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Robin! Those are my daughter's clothes!Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.38,0:20:11.05,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Aunt Roji! I wanted to try them on just once!Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.05,0:20:14.27,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,You eat a lot for someone who lives here free.Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.73,0:20:24.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you...Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.88,0:20:28.61,Main,,0,0,0,,my mother?!Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.54,0:20:38.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Hmm? What? You have a child?Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.34,0:20:40.54,Main,,0,0,0,,No.Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.46,0:20:42.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Olvia-san...Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.42,0:20:45.28,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry...Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.43,0:20:50.00,Main,,0,0,0,,but I think you're confusing me with someone else.Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.70,0:20:55.39,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, Robin! I don't wanna make you a criminal's daughter!Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.39,0:20:57.34,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Olvia...Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.74,0:20:59.28,Main,,0,0,0,,What a weird brat.Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.06,0:21:01.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's go!Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.41,0:21:19.20,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm Robin!Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.20,0:21:23.33,Main,,0,0,0,,I've grown, but don't you remember me?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.33,0:21:26.33,Main,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for you to return all this time!Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.33,0:21:28.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you...Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.04,0:21:31.30,Main,,0,0,0,,really not...Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.81,0:21:33.76,Main,,0,0,0,,my mother?Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.13,0:21:37.72,Main,,0,0,0,,I wanted you...Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.72,0:21:39.27,Main,,0,0,0,,to hold my hand...Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.52,0:21:43.47,Main,,0,0,0,,and walk with me someday...Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.47,0:21:48.35,Main,,0,0,0,,So I studied hard and was able to become an archaeologist!Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.35,0:21:50.81,Main,,0,0,0,,I can read Poneglyphs, too!Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.36,0:21:53.87,Main,,0,0,0,,That brat can?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.87,0:21:55.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop it, Robin!Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.87,0:21:57.01,Main,,0,0,0,,So...Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.01,0:22:00.32,Main,,0,0,0,,please let me stay... with you!Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.32,0:22:02.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Mother!Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.64,0:22:04.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Robin...!Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.50,0:22:07.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Please...Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.92,0:22:09.64,Main,,0,0,0,,don't leave me...Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.27,0:22:12.93,Main,,0,0,0,,alone anymore!Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.86,0:22:21.13,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! What the hell is this attack?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.13,0:22:23.73,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm exercising a Buster Call.Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.73,0:22:26.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Commence concerted fire!Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.27,0:22:30.71,Main,,0,0,0,,We're targeting everything on Ohara, the island of archaeology!Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.71,0:22:35.84,Main,,0,0,0,,The research by the Ohara scholars has reached a level we never imagined.Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.84,0:22:40.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Knowledge can be transferred. Don't let it out of that island.Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.05,0:22:45.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Annihilate the devils living in Ohara! In the name of justice!Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.40,0:22:52.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Dammit! What's going on?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.04,0:22:56.40,Main,,0,0,0,,We haven't gotten off of the island yet! Are they trying to kill us?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.35,0:23:00.10,Main,,0,0,0,,The Tree of Knowledge is taking direct hits!Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.10,0:23:02.65,Main,,0,0,0,,There's no mistaking that this is Headquarters' military power.Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.65,0:23:06.86,Main,,0,0,0,,The government was probably going to do this from the start. How foolish.Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.86,0:23:10.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Chief. That brat said that she's an archaeologist.Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.11,0:23:13.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, she did say that. I don't know if it's true or not,Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.86,0:23:16.17,Main,,0,0,0,,but when we don't know, eliminating them solves the problem.Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.17,0:23:19.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Remember her face well so that you don't let her leave the island.Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.84,0:23:21.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Retreat!Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.11,0:23:22.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Then I'll take Olvia.Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.06,0:23:27.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Forget her! No time for that now! Just leave her here!Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.49,0:23:30.26,Main,,0,0,0,,If we stay here, we'll get killed, too!Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.26,0:23:32.98,Main,,0,0,0,,My life is the most important thing!Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.98,0:23:35.77,Main,,0,0,0,,All, retreat! Go back to the ship!Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.16,0:23:46.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Do something about the fire in the library!Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.36,0:23:48.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Protect the Tree of Knowledge!Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.34,0:24:11.33,Main,,0,0,0,,I've wanted to do this...Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.66,0:24:16.53,Main,,0,0,0,,for so long!Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.45,0:24:21.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Robin!Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.58,0:24:25.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Mother!Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.42,0:24:31.49,Main,,0,0,0,,It's my fault... Robin...Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.49,0:24:35.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Is it true that you can read Poneglyphs?Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.07,0:24:39.60,Main,,0,0,0,,If I had properly kept an eye on you...Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.17,0:24:43.86,Main,,0,0,0,,I’m sorry. I just wanted…Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.86,0:24:48.06,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm really surprised to know that you've become able to do things like that.Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.06,0:24:51.74,Main,,0,0,0,,You must've tried hard and studied a lot.Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.74,0:24:55.76,Main,,0,0,0,,It's not something anyone can do. That's amazing, Robin!Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.09,0:25:06.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Fortunately, the officials from earlier are the only ones who know about it.Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.05,0:25:09.13,Main,,0,0,0,,This is no time to be sitting around here.Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.13,0:25:11.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Olvia! Take Robin and run!Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.66,0:25:14.68,Main,,0,0,0,,If you can somehow sneak Robin onto the evacuation ship,Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.68,0:25:16.28,Main,,0,0,0,,you can leave the island!Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.74,0:25:23.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Robin! There you are! I looked all over for you!Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.41,0:25:24.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Saul!Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.62,0:25:26.61,Main,,0,0,0,,So you were able to see Olvia!Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.61,0:25:29.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Saul! What are you doing on this island?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.71,0:25:35.48,Main,,0,0,0,,By some twist of fate, I got shipwrecked and saved by Robin on the beach.Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.48,0:25:37.72,Main,,0,0,0,,More importantly, the situation is terrible!Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.72,0:25:39.93,Main,,0,0,0,,You have to leave the island immediately!Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.93,0:25:41.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Please take care of Robin!Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.55,0:25:43.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Please let my daughter escape from the island at any cost!Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.59,0:25:48.02,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! No! What about you, Mom?! Aren't you gonna come with me?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.84,0:25:50.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Olvia... What are you gonna...Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.48,0:25:53.40,Main,,0,0,0,,There's still something that I have to do here, so...Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.40,0:25:57.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Mother! Don't leave me! I finally got to see you again!Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.49,0:25:59.03,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll stay here, too!Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.03,0:26:00.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Robin...Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.79,0:26:03.90,Main,,0,0,0,,You're an Ohara scholar, so you should know this very well.Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.90,0:26:05.77,Main,,0,0,0,,History is the treasure of mankind.Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.77,0:26:09.25,Main,,0,0,0,,It will illuminate the future in which your generation will live.Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.25,0:26:12.16,Main,,0,0,0,,But the history we received from the past will disappear...Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.16,0:26:15.59,Main,,0,0,0,,unless we pass it on to the next era.Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.59,0:26:17.55,Main,,0,0,0,,– Put out the fire! – Protect the books!Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.55,0:26:21.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Ohara doesn’t want to reveal our history.Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.43,0:26:24.02,Main,,0,0,0,,We just wanted to acknowledge and preserve the voices of the past.Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.02,0:26:30.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Our research will end now, but even if Ohara is obliterated...Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.63,0:26:37.15,Main,,0,0,0,,we cannot give up the future you young ones will live in!Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.94,0:26:40.16,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't understand!Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.29,0:26:44.31,Main,,0,0,0,,You will understand someday.Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.37,0:26:49.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, go, Saul!Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.25,0:26:53.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you sure about this?Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.00,0:26:54.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes.Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.70,0:26:58.37,Main,,0,0,0,,I don’t wanna go! I’ll stay with you! Mother!Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.37,0:27:01.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Mother!Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.12,0:27:04.11,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I was happy to hear you call me that.Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.85,0:27:06.63,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Thank you!Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.63,0:27:09.67,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,From now on, for you and me both...Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.67,0:27:11.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Live, Robin!Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.54,0:27:31.61,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! Vice Admiral! Vice Admiral Kuzan!Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.61,0:27:32.99,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.99,0:27:35.54,Main,,0,0,0,,On the island... Yes, there's no doubt about it!Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.54,0:27:39.12,Main,,0,0,0,,So what's the matter?! Just spit it out!Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.12,0:27:41.95,Main,,0,0,0,,It's the deserter, Vice Admiral Saul!Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.95,0:27:44.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Saul! Go back! Please!Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.30,0:27:46.54,Main,,0,0,0,,No! I can't do that!Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.54,0:27:49.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Robin! Hold your head high, Robin!Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.52,0:27:53.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Your mom is honorable! Ohara is honorable!Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.48,0:27:58.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Someday, pass down this island's history, Robin!Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.03,0:28:01.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Ohara fought against the world!Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.32,0:28:07.41,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Stop it! Capturing them is enough!Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.41,0:28:12.78,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,They're not even violent pirates! Are you so weak that you can't suppress them?!Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.78,0:28:16.49,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,We've caught history exploration ships many times,Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.49,0:28:20.54,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,but I don't understand why they had to die.Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.54,0:28:24.26,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Vice Admiral Saul! We found one survivor!Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.26,0:28:26.46,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,How dare you kill my fellow scholars?!Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.59,0:28:30.43,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Do you really want the weapon?Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.43,0:28:31.88,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,What pitiful people...Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.88,0:28:34.34,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,You don't have your own will and yet you cast judgment on us...Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.34,0:28:35.80,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Hey! He's a Vice Admiral!Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.80,0:28:39.94,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,not doubting laws and saying it's to prevent the revival of the weapon!Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.94,0:28:44.53,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,You're just frightened by the history that you don't even know!Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.75,0:28:47.53,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,This is a top-secret mission.Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.53,0:28:49.70,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,A Buster Call?Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.70,0:28:53.60,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Five Vice Admirals command ten battleships in a Buster Call.Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.60,0:28:55.21,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I want you to be one of them.Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.39,0:28:59.16,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,They are just scholars! Why do we have to go that far?Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.16,0:29:01.00,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Those scholars that we've captured, too!Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.00,0:29:05.12,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,They look like they just really want to know the history to me!Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.12,0:29:08.92,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,If their research is so dangerous, the Government should help them, too!Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.92,0:29:11.84,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,We're the ones who actually have to kill people!Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.84,0:29:15.13,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Give me the proof that they're completely evil!Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.13,0:29:18.34,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Are you doubting the Government? Shut up and follow orders!Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.06,0:29:27.10,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'd like to ask you some questions.Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.10,0:29:31.07,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,This is an emergency! Vice Admiral Saul took a criminal and deserted!Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.82,0:29:35.54,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,He knows everything about the operation.Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.54,0:29:38.75,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,After them! Capture Saul and Olvia without fail!Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.75,0:29:41.19,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,You can shoot them if needed!Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.19,0:29:44.70,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Pursuers are coming! I'll deal with them!Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.70,0:29:47.67,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,You'll never be able to go back to the Navy, Saul.Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.67,0:29:52.65,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,That's fine. I can't stay in the Navy having this sense of distrust.Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.65,0:29:57.09,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Even if they're obeying the law, this operation is too tyrannical.Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.09,0:29:59.34,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'm just following my sense of justice.Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.34,0:30:02.30,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Now, hurry to your homeland to let people know.Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.30,0:30:03.85,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna thank you for this.Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.85,0:30:06.02,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Good luck.Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.58,0:30:11.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Fire!Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.42,0:30:16.29,Main,,0,0,0,,They're aiming at me!Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.59,0:30:22.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Saul!Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.13,0:30:23.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Ah! It hit him!Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.78,0:30:24.91,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.91,0:30:28.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't apologize! He's already those evil people's accomplice!Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.13,0:30:32.51,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Robin. That must've scared you.Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.27,0:30:35.27,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Hold on a sec.Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.27,0:30:41.18,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,That must be it! Firing this close? What if you had hurt Robin?!Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.53,0:30:44.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Vice Admiral! Please stop! What're you doing?!Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.18,0:30:49.17,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't know what justice is in this situation, so I'll just protect my friend!Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.17,0:30:51.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop it! Saul!Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.79,0:30:53.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Be prepared!Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.25,0:30:59.74,Main,,0,0,0,,If you make an enemy of me, I'll make you pay for it!Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.42,0:31:08.81,Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing: Feeso, Galaxy 9000  Timing: Halee  Quality Assurance: Feeso, Galaxy 9000, Pepperjack, Sewil  Soundtracking: Halee  Title & Infoboxes: Datenshi  Karaoke: KaitouYahiko  Translation: CrunchyrollDialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.14,0:00:00.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HDialogue: 2,0:00:00.17,0:00:00.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 2,0:00:00.21,0:00:01.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,sDialogue: 2,0:00:00.24,0:00:01.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,hDialogue: 2,0:00:00.28,0:00:01.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,iDialogue: 3,0:00:01.09,0:00:01.87,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,shiDialogue: 3,0:00:01.09,0:00:01.87,Karaoke,,0,